\b 2026-03-07\b0\par
- Version: 0.2.0\par
- Summary: Added CH422G backlight control with manual settings toggle, touch-to-wake, and 30-second automatic backlight timeout.\par
- Notes: `main/ui_screen.c` now exposes a `Display Backlight` switch on the Settings page, `main/hardware_init.*` provides fixed known-good CH422G masks for backlight on/off, and `main/lvgl_port.c` restores the backlight on touch while a 1-second software timer turns it off after 30 seconds without touch. The minor digit was increased from `0.1.11` to `0.2.0` because this is a new user-visible behavior set rather than a simple patch release.\par
- Resolved Defects:\par
  - None in this release.\par
\par
\b 2026-03-07\b0\par
- Version: 0.2.1\par
- Summary: Reworked the main UI layout so all workflow content lives inside the top tab region with a persistent bottom clock bar.\par
- Notes: `main/ui_screen.c` now keeps the tabview in the upper 90\% of the screen, renders the RTC clock in a dedicated lower 10\% bar, moves live status text into each tab page, and converts press/toggle controls to button-style widgets with pressed/check-state color changes and motion. `main/peripherals_manager.*` now exposes RTC reads for the shared clock bar.\par
- Resolved Defects:\par
  - None in this release.\par
\par
\b 2026-03-08\b0\par
- Version: 0.2.2\par
- Summary: Added manual RTC clock setting and preserved retained RTC time across restart, with a working fallback serial-monitor path on Windows.\par
- Notes: `main/peripherals_manager.*` now keeps valid retained RTC time and exposes an explicit RTC setter API, `main/ui_screen.c` now adds a `Set Clock` Settings overlay with rollers and a `Done` action, `.vscode/tasks.json` and `scripts/setup_idf_env.ps1` now separate flash from monitor usage, and `scripts/monitor_capture.ps1` provides a raw serial capture fallback that successfully verifies the first 20 seconds of startup logs on this host.\par
- Resolved Defects:\par
  - None in this release.\par
\par
